---
import Icon from '../icons/Icon.astro';
---

<section id="services" class="py-24 border-t border-[#E5E7EB] dark:border-[#1E2636] bg-white dark:bg-[#0A0E17] transition-colors duration-200">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <!-- Section Header in Lamossa Style -->
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between mb-16 gap-6">
      <div class="space-y-4 max-w-2xl">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#FF4D36]/10 text-[#FF4D36] text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider font-mono">
          <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-sm bg-[#FF4D36]"></span>
          <span>Core Capabilities</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-neutral-950 dark:text-white">
          Driven by intelligence. <br />
          <span class="text-[#FF4D36]">Focused on revenue velocity.</span>
        </h2>
      </div>

      <p class="text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 text-sm sm:text-base max-w-md leading-relaxed">
        From sub-10s WhatsApp lead triage to automated 60-second video social proof, New-Relay powers every customer touchpoint.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 4 Numbered Bento Grid Cards (Lamossa Style) -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-6">
      
      <!-- Card 01: Omnichannel Inbox (7 cols) -->
      <div class="md:col-span-7 p-8 rounded-3xl bg-[#F6F7F8] dark:bg-[#0E131C] border border-[#E5E7EB] dark:border-[#1E2636] flex flex-col justify-between space-y-6 hover:border-[#FF4D36]/40 transition-all shadow-sm group">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-[#FF4D36] px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-white dark:bg-[#161D2B] border border-[#E5E7EB] dark:border-[#222938]">
              01 // INGESTION
            </span>
            <span class="text-[11px] font-mono text-neutral-400">Sub-10ms Carrier Stream</span>
          </div>

          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-neutral-950 dark:text-white">Omnichannel Team Inbox</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed max-w-lg">
            Stop switching between 5 fragmented apps. WhatsApp Business API, 2-way SMS, Live Chat, and Email flow into a single collaborative stream with collision locking and auto-routing.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-[#131926] border border-[#E5E7EB] dark:border-[#222938] space-y-2 text-xs font-mono">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-neutral-400">
            <span>● 4 Channels Ingesting</span>
            <span class="text-emerald-500 font-bold">100% Delivery SLA</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 pt-1">
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-600 text-[10px]">WhatsApp API</span>
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-blue-500/10 text-blue-600 text-[10px]">2-Way SMS</span>
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-purple-500/10 text-purple-600 text-[10px]">Live Webchat</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 02: Captain AI (5 cols) -->
      <div class="md:col-span-5 p-8 rounded-3xl bg-[#F6F7F8] dark:bg-[#0E131C] border border-[#E5E7EB] dark:border-[#1E2636] flex flex-col justify-between space-y-6 hover:border-[#FF4D36]/40 transition-all shadow-sm group">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-[#FF4D36] px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-white dark:bg-[#161D2B] border border-[#E5E7EB] dark:border-[#222938]">
              02 // AI AGENT
            </span>
            <span class="text-[11px] font-mono text-emerald-500">99.6% Precision</span>
          </div>

          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-neutral-950 dark:text-white">Captain AI Autonomous Resolver</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed">
            24/7 lead resolution grounded on your company PDFs and pricing sheets. Zero hallucinations with strict deterministic guardrails.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-[#131926] border border-[#E5E7EB] dark:border-[#222938] space-y-1.5 text-xs">
          <div class="text-[10px] text-neutral-400 font-mono">Autonomous Execution:</div>
          <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white">"Qualified $75k CloudScale Deal & Booked Demo in 8s."</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 03: CRM & Pipelines (5 cols) -->
      <div class="md:col-span-5 p-8 rounded-3xl bg-[#F6F7F8] dark:bg-[#0E131C] border border-[#E5E7EB] dark:border-[#1E2636] flex flex-col justify-between space-y-6 hover:border-[#FF4D36]/40 transition-all shadow-sm group">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-[#FF4D36] px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-white dark:bg-[#161D2B] border border-[#E5E7EB] dark:border-[#222938]">
              03 // REVENUE CRM
            </span>
            <span class="text-[11px] font-mono text-neutral-400">Live Stage Sync</span>
          </div>

          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-neutral-950 dark:text-white">CRM & Deal Pipelines</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed">
            Drag-and-drop visual Kanban velocity. Automatic deal creation upon high-intent prospect message with real-time ARR attribution.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-[#131926] border border-[#E5E7EB] dark:border-[#222938] flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-mono">
          <span class="text-neutral-400">Active Pipeline Value:</span>
          <span class="font-bold text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400">$1,480,000 ARR</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 04: Video Social Proof (7 cols) -->
      <div class="md:col-span-7 p-8 rounded-3xl bg-[#F6F7F8] dark:bg-[#0E131C] border border-[#E5E7EB] dark:border-[#1E2636] flex flex-col justify-between space-y-6 hover:border-[#FF4D36]/40 transition-all shadow-sm group">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-[#FF4D36] px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-white dark:bg-[#161D2B] border border-[#E5E7EB] dark:border-[#222938]">
              04 // REPUTATION
            </span>
            <span class="text-[11px] font-mono text-amber-500">4.9 ★ Rating</span>
          </div>

          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-neutral-950 dark:text-white">60s Video Social Proof Engine</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed max-w-lg">
            Frictionless browser-based video recording widget. Automatically trigger SMS & WhatsApp review requests post-purchase to gather authentic 5-star testimonials.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-[#131926] border border-[#E5E7EB] dark:border-[#222938] flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-mono">
          <span class="text-neutral-400">Automated Review Collection:</span>
          <span class="font-bold text-[#FF4D36]">4.8x Higher Response Rate</span>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
